  "releaseNotes": "v3.240.20:\n\t\t- Added GetExchangeLogicModulesAsync and the ExchangeLogicModule model (setting/logicmodules/metadata),\n\t\t  returning all LogicModules of all types in one call with installation, lifecycle and upgrade state.\n\t\t  A module has an update available when ExchangeLogicModule.HasUpdateAvailable is true.\n\t\t- Deprecated GetLogicModuleUpdatesAsync, LogicModuleUpdate and LogicModuleUpdateCollection: the underlying\n\t\t  listcore endpoint has been retired by LogicMonitor. Use GetExchangeLogicModulesAsync instead.",
